## minidbg demo 2/2. Run it with:
##     minidbg -x demo/segfault.cmds ./build/examples/segfault
## (Lines starting with ## are not shown in the recording.)
# minidbg demo 2/2: catching a crash
#
# 1. Just run it. The debugger stops at the crash instead of losing it
continue
# 2. Where did it die? Walk the call stack
bt
# 3. Let the signal through: the program dies the normal way
continue
quit
